# Only install package versions published at least 7 days ago. Malicious
# releases are usually found and pulled from npm within hours or days, so this
# keeps a freshly hijacked version out of the project. Versions already in
# package-lock.json are unaffected. For an urgent fix that is newer, run once:
#   npm install <pkg>@<version> --min-release-age=0
min-release-age=7
